      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "at some point during the Steam Audio Beta, they were not stripped; we tested this more than once and in many different worlds \n\ni'm personally more worried about the consistent failure to document these changes in a way that allows us to prepare for entire functionality to be lost",
